Old variant of earlier {{nrhot|en|darse|notext=1}}, from Late {{inh|en|enm|darse}} (also as {{m|enm|dace}} already), from {{der|en|fro|darz}}, {{lg|oblique}} {{lg|plural}} form of {{m|fro|dart||spear; javelin}}.<br/>
For a similar loss of ''r'', compare {{m|en|bass}}, while for the pronunciation with {{IPAchar|/eɪ/}}, see {{m|en|scarce}}.

